WEBVTT

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:04.820
A transfer student?

00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:07.110
Yeah! I heard he's from Tokyo!

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:09.680
Um... I think his name is...

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:11.870
Tsutsumi Ayumu!

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:16.950
Hanabi, is it true that you know Tsutsumi?

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:20.480
Yeah, we were in the same class in kindergarten.

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:22.580
Oh? What was he like?

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:29.150
He has arrived!

00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:31.040
He's here!

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:34.710
He didn't just come to kindergarten, he arrived.

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:35.530
Give me those.

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:39.880
"Everything is mine!" is the vibe he gave off.

00:00:40.810 --> 00:00:43.310
He was called the Emperor.

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:47.970
Tsutsumi, I heard you came from Tokyo!

00:00:47.970 --> 00:00:50.420
I often go to Tokyo, too!

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:52.500
Like over here.

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:55.770
You read such guidebooks, you bumpkin?

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:01.520
What are you looking at, shorty?

00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:08.210
Ayase Hanabi, age 12.

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:11.970
I feel a storm brewing in our class.

00:02:58.540 --> 00:03:02.720
Tsutsumi moved to Tokyo when he was in first grade, right?

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:04.170
Y-Yeah.

00:03:04.170 --> 00:03:06.740
So even though he was here for kindergarten,

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:09.030
he only seemed to recognize you, Hanabi.

00:03:09.030 --> 00:03:09.920
Eh?

00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:12.490
Hey, Hanabi.

00:03:14.810 --> 00:03:16.020
Lend me your eraser.

00:03:16.020 --> 00:03:17.570
Uh, no.

00:03:17.570 --> 00:03:19.690
I just bought this and I really like it.

00:03:23.410 --> 00:03:25.050
Oh, the ears fell off.

00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:26.310
Oh well.

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:28.620
That's not nice at all!

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:29.490
Hey!

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:38.090
Can you stop teasing my girlfriend?

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:40.400
Takao!

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:43.910
Girlfriend? Her?

00:03:43.910 --> 00:03:46.620
An update on our boyfriend-girlfriend quotes!

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:48.260
What's with these guys?

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:53.800
We are collecting the amazing quotations from our glorious Takao every day.

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:56.130
Really?

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:58.260
She's a shorty and flat as a board.

00:03:58.260 --> 00:04:00.510
Flat?

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:04.950
That's fine if you don't understand.

00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:08.520
I wouldn't like it if you fall for Ayase.

00:04:12.430 --> 00:04:15.070
No one's stealing her from you.

00:04:15.370 --> 00:04:16.910
P.E. class is next.

00:04:16.910 --> 00:04:18.220
Don't you need to go change?

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:20.140
Yes.

00:04:21.730 --> 00:04:25.210
That was so embarrassing! But...

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:30.120
Okay! Let's start class!

00:04:30.730 --> 00:04:32.740
We are dancing today.

00:04:32.740 --> 00:04:37.460
It's your first time with us, so just watch everyone dance for now.

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:38.630
Okay.

00:04:38.890 --> 00:04:41.320
I'll start the music, okay?

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:43.590
Let's run through it once.

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:44.960
Okay!

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:51.370
You've all remembered the gist of it!

00:04:51.370 --> 00:04:54.060
We'll have a test next week.

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:56.400
Please split up into groups and practice.

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:57.870
Okay!

00:04:57.870 --> 00:05:00.790
Let's use the remaining class time to practice in groups!

00:05:00.790 --> 00:05:02.610
Okay!

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:03.780
Let's do our best!

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:04.720
Okay!

00:05:12.360 --> 00:05:13.460
Tsutsumi!

00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:18.510
Would you like to join our group and practice the dance?

00:05:18.510 --> 00:05:19.630
Nope.

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:24.210
I'm not gonna get along with anyone here at this school.

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:30.240
That's what he said?

00:05:30.240 --> 00:05:31.950
That's too much!

00:05:31.950 --> 00:05:34.240
He's so haughty!

00:05:34.240 --> 00:05:36.060
Yeah! Yeah!

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:37.960
We're already sixth graders!

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:40.880
He's still acting like he's the Emperor!

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:42.750
Hey, Tsutsumi.

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:46.980
Is it true that you can meet lots of celebrities in Tokyo?

00:05:46.980 --> 00:05:48.920
I don't know. Not interested.

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:51.350
He said he's not interested!

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:52.820
He's so cool!

00:05:52.820 --> 00:05:55.700
People in Tokyo get scouted every day, right?

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:57.730
I've talked with someone from Tokyo today!

00:05:57.730 --> 00:06:00.140
Maybe I'll get scouted next?

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:03.460
This is why I hate the boonies.

00:06:09.350 --> 00:06:12.570
He's having that bored look again.

00:06:19.280 --> 00:06:22.530
Why is Tsutsumi always like that?

00:06:22.530 --> 00:06:24.030
Ayase.

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:25.970
Oh, Takao!

00:06:30.710 --> 00:06:33.050
Here, Takao.

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:36.280
A profile sheet? For me?

00:06:36.490 --> 00:06:37.610
Yes!

00:06:40.860 --> 00:06:44.200
Huh? He doesn't seem too happy...

00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:47.170
Um...

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:50.300
I want you to fill one out.

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:52.870
I want to know what you like and stuff.

00:06:56.610 --> 00:06:58.790
No good?

00:07:00.590 --> 00:07:03.230
Nah, it's fine.

00:07:07.480 --> 00:07:08.880
Want to go home together?

00:07:11.340 --> 00:07:14.700
I promised Yui and the others that we'd go home together.

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:15.710
I'm sorry.

00:07:15.710 --> 00:07:19.150
It's fine. All right, see you tomorrow.

00:07:19.150 --> 00:07:20.060
Okay!

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:24.200
Yui and the others are late.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:27.610
Tsutsumi!

00:07:31.460 --> 00:07:33.900
So he goes home by himself.

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:38.550
He won't make any friends with that attitude!

00:07:38.550 --> 00:07:41.610
No, no! Having no friends is so lonely!

00:07:41.610 --> 00:07:44.130
Then how can I become friends with him?

00:07:44.130 --> 00:07:46.730
I don't know anything about Tsutsumi!

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:53.930
A profile sheet?

00:07:53.930 --> 00:07:55.840
Yeah! A profile sheet!

00:07:55.840 --> 00:07:57.830
I can find out what his birthday is and his hobbies!

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:01.970
What he likes, what he doesn't like, a profile book will tell all!

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:07.350
Yeah! The first step to become friends is a profile sheet!

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:13.030
That's what Hanabi said, so can you fill one out?

00:08:15.850 --> 00:08:17.770
Why are you telling me this?

00:08:17.770 --> 00:08:19.830
She should have told me directly.

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:22.870
Because you're scary!

00:08:22.870 --> 00:08:25.410
She says you're too scary to talk to directly.

00:08:25.410 --> 00:08:27.940
Marin!

00:08:30.210 --> 00:08:31.910
Tsutsumi, um...

00:08:36.960 --> 00:08:40.490
Tsutsumi hasn't matured at all!

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:42.710
So what about that profile sheet?

00:08:42.710 --> 00:08:45.310
We gave him another one, of course.

00:08:45.310 --> 00:08:46.410
Aoi!

00:08:46.410 --> 00:08:47.950
Oh, Hiyama!

00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:48.840
Here.

00:08:53.370 --> 00:08:54.960
Hey, hey, what's that?

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:57.060
Hiyama's profile sheet?

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:02.720
Why a rhinoceros beetle?

00:09:02.720 --> 00:09:04.920
Hiyama's a rhinoceros beetle?

00:09:05.180 --> 00:09:06.860
That's impossible.

00:09:18.920 --> 00:09:22.240
Yes, yes, that's a maiden in love!

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:23.710
How nice!

00:09:23.710 --> 00:09:26.540
I haven't received one from Takao yet.

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:28.500
Even though you two are going out?

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.400
Oh dear!

00:09:31.190 --> 00:09:35.350
Hanabi hasn't gotten a profile sheet from Takao?

00:09:35.350 --> 00:09:36.920
Unbelievable!

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:40.870
I had him fill one out for me on the first day we were classmates!

00:09:40.870 --> 00:09:42.220
Look!

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:45.170
You're his girlfriend and he hasn't even filled one out for you.

00:09:45.170 --> 00:09:47.060
I guess you fail as his girlfriend?

00:09:47.970 --> 00:09:50.220
R-Really?

00:09:50.850 --> 00:09:55.600
One, two, one... Like this?

00:09:56.040 --> 00:09:58.380
Then like this.

00:09:58.380 --> 00:10:07.560
One, two, one, two...

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:08.050
One...

00:10:08.050 --> 00:10:08.940
Ayase.

00:10:10.270 --> 00:10:11.070
Practicing by yourself?

00:10:11.070 --> 00:10:15.110
Yep. I'm pretty bad at dancing.

00:10:15.980 --> 00:10:19.530
Yeah, you trip over yourself at times.

00:10:23.340 --> 00:10:24.370
Here.

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:27.850
I thought it'd help, so I copied the song over.

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:29.090
Want to hear it together?

00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:41.340
Ayase, you need to remember the song first before you start dancing.

00:10:41.830 --> 00:10:43.420
Y-Yeah.

00:10:44.360 --> 00:10:47.300
I can't remember the song at all!

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:54.220
Takao is so close to me...

00:10:54.220 --> 00:10:55.530
Ayase.

00:11:06.090 --> 00:11:07.850
Takao's hair...

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:11.140
So soft...

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:17.900
What should I do? I'm sure Takao can hear my heartbeat...

00:11:19.140 --> 00:11:23.040
Ayase, did you get along with Tsutsumi before?

00:11:23.040 --> 00:11:23.910
Eh?

00:11:24.610 --> 00:11:27.650
You're working hard at trying to become Tsutsumi's friend.

00:11:29.470 --> 00:11:34.330
That's because Tsutsumi looks down at our school.

00:11:34.330 --> 00:11:41.040
Takao and Yui... I don't want him to hate the people I love.

00:11:47.610 --> 00:11:48.750
Do your best.

00:11:51.420 --> 00:11:54.270
Ayase Hanabi, age 12.

00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:57.730
I love Takao so much!

00:12:10.210 --> 00:12:12.320
Did the music help?

00:12:12.320 --> 00:12:14.050
Yes! Thank you!

00:12:14.050 --> 00:12:17.550
Oh yeah, Takao, the profile sheet...

00:12:17.550 --> 00:12:22.720
Yeah, I'll give it to you soon.

00:12:23.140 --> 00:12:25.310
O-Okay!

00:12:26.710 --> 00:12:28.890
How is she any good?

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:34.590
He hasn't given it to you yet?

00:12:34.590 --> 00:12:38.400
Nope, but I don't want to force him.

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:41.000
Why wouldn't he fill it out?

00:12:44.710 --> 00:12:47.920
She wants something like this that much?

00:12:48.270 --> 00:12:54.720
What? Hanabi hasn't received a profile sheet from Takao yet?

00:12:55.930 --> 00:12:58.670
What's the matter? Your face is all red.

00:12:58.670 --> 00:12:59.860
Oh, shut up!

00:12:59.860 --> 00:13:02.010
Huh? You thought they were talking about you?

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:03.460
Impossible.

00:13:03.460 --> 00:13:07.530
I have Takao's photo with me!

00:13:07.530 --> 00:13:09.370
Eh? I want one!

00:13:09.370 --> 00:13:11.430
What should I do?
Eh? I want one!

00:13:11.430 --> 00:13:13.740
Oh my, your eraser is so cute.

00:13:13.740 --> 00:13:16.390
Can I borrow that pen for a bit?

00:13:16.390 --> 00:13:20.520
I'll tell you what foods Takao likes, so give me that memo book.

00:13:21.550 --> 00:13:26.790
Hanabi, if you give me your ribbon, then I'll tell you what Takao's hobbies are!

00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:31.250
No!

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:34.990
I don't want to find out about his profile sheet behind his back.

00:13:35.860 --> 00:13:38.270
What's with you, holding it in like that?

00:13:38.270 --> 00:13:41.140
You're his girlfriend and yet he never gave you a profile sheet.

00:13:41.140 --> 00:13:49.600
Since I pity you so much,
let me tell you all about Takao.

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:53.200
I don't want to hear it.

00:13:56.050 --> 00:13:59.420
I don't want to know about the one I love like this!

00:14:00.140 --> 00:14:02.110
Acting all nice!

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:11.480
What's going on here?

00:14:11.480 --> 00:14:13.020
Takao!

00:14:13.020 --> 00:14:15.710
You gave a profile sheet to me only, right?

00:14:15.710 --> 00:14:19.660
It's because I'm special, right?

00:14:21.280 --> 00:14:25.130
Oh, that? I think everything has changed on that.

00:14:26.140 --> 00:14:28.990
And if you have any more photos of me, I'd like them back.

00:14:28.990 --> 00:14:30.950
I don't like it when people secretly take photos of me.

00:14:31.540 --> 00:14:33.500
No way...

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:38.040
What you like and what you dislike won't stay unchanged.

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:40.680
That's why I didn't want to fill out a profile sheet.

00:14:41.890 --> 00:14:43.690
I wanted to tell you directly.

00:14:44.160 --> 00:14:45.820
Because I'm right here at your side.

00:14:48.550 --> 00:14:50.260
Takao!

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:53.350
Another quote!

00:14:54.050 --> 00:14:56.620
Just ask me directly what you want to know.

00:14:58.110 --> 00:15:00.800
I'll answer all of your questions.

00:15:02.930 --> 00:15:04.000
Okay!

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:06.230
There it is!

00:15:06.230 --> 00:15:07.040
Of course!

00:15:07.040 --> 00:15:08.310
More quotes!

00:15:08.310 --> 00:15:09.400
Got them!

00:15:09.400 --> 00:15:11.060
Double date!

00:15:11.060 --> 00:15:12.680
Thank you very much!

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:15.060
One, two, one, two.

00:15:15.290 --> 00:15:17.000
Was it like that?

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:19.270
Yep! And then like this.

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:19.950
Really?

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:24.390
Tsutsumi!

00:15:24.390 --> 00:15:25.910
Tsutsumi, what about that profile sheet...

00:15:25.910 --> 00:15:27.870
Of course I'm not writing one.

00:15:29.180 --> 00:15:32.240
Why don't you join our dance group?

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:36.170
I'm pretty bad, but I've practiced and can teach you the moves.

00:15:36.170 --> 00:15:36.920
Okay?

00:15:36.920 --> 00:15:39.820
No one wants to be with someone who is this terrible.

00:15:40.400 --> 00:15:41.690
What did you say!?

00:15:41.690 --> 00:15:44.350
You said my dancing is terrible!?

00:15:44.350 --> 00:15:46.030
Violence is not good!

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:55.360
It's a sprain, so it'll take about two weeks to heal.

00:15:55.360 --> 00:15:57.600
Please do not do any strenuous exercises.

00:15:58.090 --> 00:16:00.100
Okay, Doctor.

00:16:03.280 --> 00:16:05.760
I practiced so much, too.

00:16:05.760 --> 00:16:08.640
Takao, everyone, I'm sorry.

00:16:10.670 --> 00:16:12.470
Look at this E!

00:16:13.220 --> 00:16:14.480
Looks nice.

00:16:14.480 --> 00:16:16.890
Just watching is so boring.

00:16:16.890 --> 00:16:20.250
Everyone looks so happy dancing! How nice!

00:16:22.030 --> 00:16:22.940
Oh yeah!

00:16:24.200 --> 00:16:25.580
Tsutsumi.

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:26.890
What?

00:16:26.890 --> 00:16:28.510
I'm not apologizing.

00:16:28.510 --> 00:16:30.310
You fell by yourself.

00:16:30.310 --> 00:16:31.590
I'm sorry.

00:16:32.670 --> 00:16:37.060
I didn't want to see you look so bored.

00:16:37.500 --> 00:16:41.030
But it really is boring just watching from the sidelines.

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:45.170
I figured that out today by watching.

00:16:45.170 --> 00:16:46.550
I'm sorry.

00:16:47.670 --> 00:16:51.810
But even though we can't dance, we can still cheer everyone on!

00:16:51.810 --> 00:16:53.190
Come on! Go! Go!

00:16:53.190 --> 00:16:54.120
You idiot! Stop moving around so much!
Come on! Go! Go!

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:56.040
You idiot! Stop moving around so much!

00:16:58.030 --> 00:17:00.340
Hanabi! Are you okay?

00:17:00.340 --> 00:17:01.930
I'm fine, I'm fine.

00:17:01.930 --> 00:17:04.460
Anyway, that turn was amazing!

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:06.070
Oh, really?

00:17:06.070 --> 00:17:09.130
Yep! I'll cheer all of you on!

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:10.250
Do your best!

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:10.930
Okay!

00:17:10.930 --> 00:17:12.660
You can do it, Marin!

00:17:12.660 --> 00:17:13.670
Leave it to me!

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:18.330
What's with this girl?

00:17:21.330 --> 00:17:25.100
Let's start the test, everyone!

00:17:29.720 --> 00:17:32.200
Huh? That's weird.

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:37.490
The CD is gone.

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:40.850
Huh? Ayase was in charge of the CD, right?

00:17:40.850 --> 00:17:43.100
I got it!

00:17:43.100 --> 00:17:47.820
Ayase, you were trying to stall the test, so you hid the CD!

00:17:47.820 --> 00:17:50.320
I didn't do that!

00:17:51.770 --> 00:17:55.160
Just because you're the only one who can't take the test!

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:56.470
Hand it over already!

00:17:57.890 --> 00:17:59.880
Sorry about that!

00:17:59.880 --> 00:18:03.430
My class forgot to return the CD after using it.

00:18:07.760 --> 00:18:09.460
Now we're good.

00:18:09.460 --> 00:18:10.820
Thank goodness.

00:18:10.820 --> 00:18:13.480
That's all? Let's start the test already.

00:18:13.480 --> 00:18:14.210
Wait!

00:18:15.910 --> 00:18:19.700
You suspected Hanabi out of the blue like that.

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:22.970
Shouldn't you apologize first?

00:18:24.350 --> 00:18:25.710
Tsutsumi!

00:18:26.150 --> 00:18:31.460
That's right. I should have checked before starting class.

00:18:31.460 --> 00:18:33.890
I'm sorry, Ayase.

00:18:33.890 --> 00:18:36.510
Sorry, Ayase.

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:38.400
Hey! You too!

00:18:38.400 --> 00:18:39.100
Me?

00:18:39.100 --> 00:18:40.880
Wasn't this all your fault?

00:18:42.090 --> 00:18:47.260
He was a scary Emperor in the past...

00:18:49.620 --> 00:18:51.070
Hurry up!

00:18:51.070 --> 00:18:54.080
Sure, sure, my bad.

00:18:56.120 --> 00:18:57.500
Thank you!

00:19:06.400 --> 00:19:09.120
Tsutsumi, have you remembered the dance yet?

00:19:09.120 --> 00:19:11.010
I guess so.

00:19:11.010 --> 00:19:15.890
Since Ayase is sitting out, why don't you join her group and dance?

00:19:15.890 --> 00:19:17.790
What a pain.

00:19:41.300 --> 00:19:42.700
Violence is no good!

00:19:45.420 --> 00:19:46.840
I'm fine, I'm fine!

00:19:47.150 --> 00:19:50.490
Anyway, that turn was amazing!

00:19:57.810 --> 00:19:59.140
Thank you!

00:19:59.580 --> 00:20:03.600
What's this feeling?

00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:05.030
Why am I...

00:20:06.850 --> 00:20:08.650
Wow!

00:20:08.650 --> 00:20:11.060
Is everyone from Tokyo this good at dancing?

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:12.770
Let's do the running man!

00:20:15.710 --> 00:20:16.830
Tsutsumi!

00:20:18.310 --> 00:20:21.230
You were so cool just now!

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:24.870
Move it!

00:20:24.870 --> 00:20:25.900
It's our turn!

00:20:27.940 --> 00:20:28.890
Hanabi!

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:39.760
That was dangerous.

00:20:39.760 --> 00:20:41.770
S-Sorry.

00:20:45.630 --> 00:20:48.690
What a shot! The lovely couple in a hot embrace!

00:20:48.690 --> 00:20:51.330
This will be our headline tomorrow, chief editor!

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:52.010
Yeah!

00:20:52.500 --> 00:20:53.650
Get out of my way.

00:20:53.650 --> 00:20:56.570
What's with you? That was a great shot.

00:21:11.440 --> 00:21:15.480
It's not like I filled this out just to be her friend.

00:21:20.950 --> 00:21:22.330
Hanabi...

00:21:38.550 --> 00:21:41.240
Ayase Hanabi, age 12.

00:21:41.240 --> 00:21:46.360
We will fill out the blanks on the profile sheet with our memories!

00:23:22.360 --> 00:23:26.030
Class 6-2's first triangle relationship!

00:23:26.030 --> 00:23:27.640
Isn't that right, my man?

00:23:27.640 --> 00:23:29.160
That's correct!

00:23:35.710 --> 00:23:36.990
It's finally here!

00:23:36.990 --> 00:23:39.800
Birthdays as a couple!

00:23:39.800 --> 00:23:41.570
Our first present!

00:23:41.570 --> 00:23:44.520
What should I give Takao? I'm so lost!

00:23:45.220 --> 00:23:47.420
Tsutsumi will help me choose?

00:23:47.420 --> 00:23:49.030
What's going on here?

00:23:49.030 --> 00:23:51.690
Let our hearts' throb together!
